\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   I will not forsake my Lord,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For, He won't forsake me.
\par He shows paths of righteousness
\par And when I go astray,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He makes a search for me,
\par All through the day and all night
\par He thinks of me and nurse me
\par And makes me feel secure.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. On Him do I place my trust
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In times of stress and toil.
\par Never shall I be despaired,
\par He is my comforter.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All that I possess now,
\par Both mortal and spiritual,
\par The body and the soul
\par I surrender to Him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  He gives unto us only
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 what He deems good for us.
\par Out of His great compassion,
\par He gave His only Son,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His own beloved one.
\par What else shall He refuse us?
\par Won't He fight to redeem us?
\par He is our Redeemer.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. This world is only transient,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 It's contents shall perish.
\par All its glories shall vanish,
\par When we have all expired,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And departed from here,
\par We shall be raised in future,
\par To live with Him forever,
\par In the kingdom above.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  By the grace of our Jesus,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Our souls shall not perish.
\par The body will get transformed,
\par And be in a new state,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Pious and brightened too,
\par It shall receive vibrancy,
\par Assuming Godly nature,
\par And rejuvenation.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. When I'm beset with troubles
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And pains become my lot,
\par I shall not be overcome,
\par Redemption shall be mine.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And I'll rejoice always,
\par For Christ shall consummate me
\par And with Him I shall live.
\par forth, and forevermore.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

